  summary "Sleek☽ Caemomot, a deep-tunnel merchant collective, is selling premium Fire-Cores (Classes II–IV) and Deep-Seam Relics sourced from consolidated underground seams, with prices in fire-crystal or aurora-shard currency and guaranteed passage through the Thrall☽ Vavmastius corridor. The merchant emphasizes the quality and longevity of their stock—particularly the purple-spectrum Class III and IV units that burn twice as long as surface-logged alternatives—and offers tripartite certification services for existing inventory. Operating under the seal of the Swaleed~ Luminary's unextinguished flame, Sleek☽ Caemomot has maintained authentication credibility through three wars and positions itself as the only reliable supplier for serious craftspeople and engineers seeking deep-sourced materials."
